{"path":"biology/biotech/bioengineering/pcr-technology","title":"PCR 技术·原理与过程辨析","type":"example","html":"<p>关于 PCR（聚合酶链式反应）技术，下列叙述正确的是（ ）</p>\n<p>A. PCR 过程中通过高温使 DNA 双链解旋，不需要解旋酶</p>\n<p>B. 延伸阶段需要 RNA 聚合酶</p>\n<p>C. PCR 只需要一端的引物即可扩增</p>\n<p>D. PCR 的产物是 RNA 单链</p>\n<ul>\n<li>扩增倍数：起始有 1 个 DNA 分子，<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span> 次循环后约 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 个拷贝（含混合产物，第 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span> 轮才纯）；若起始 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span> 个 → <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m\\cdot2^n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>；</li>\n<li>延伸方向：Taq 酶沿模板 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>3</mn><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3&#x27;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>→<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>5</mn><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5&#x27;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 方向合成（新链 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>5</mn><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>→</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5&#x27;\\to3&#x27;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 延伸）——引物的方向与模板互补配对，这在&quot;设计引物序列&quot;题里是关键;</li>\n<li>应用：扩增目的基因、检测病原体（新冠病毒检测）、亲子鉴定、基因测序前处理；</li>\n<li>变式：①引物设计（要与模板 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>3</mn><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3&#x27;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 端互补）；②若某电泳图/条带数判断循环次数；③&quot;实时荧光定量 PCR&quot;（RT-PCR）——反转录为 DNA 后用 PCR 定量；</li>\n<li>真题关联：PCR 原理与应用为新教材生物选填/情境题常客（疫情检测题年年在出）。🔗 真题公开资料：<a href=\"https://gaokao.neea.edu.cn/\">中国教育考试网·普通高考</a>（官方试题评析）。</li>\n</ul>\n","standardHtml":"<p><strong>PCR 三步骤循环</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>变性</strong>（<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>92</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>9</mn><msup><mn>5</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">92\\sim95^\\circ\\mathrm{C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">92</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">9</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6741em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∘</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">C</span></span></span></span>）：高温使 DNA 双链间氢键断裂而<strong>解旋</strong>（替代体内解旋酶的&quot;蛋白解旋+ATP&quot;方式）；</li>\n<li><strong>退火（复性）</strong>（<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>50</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>6</mn><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">50\\sim60^\\circ\\mathrm{C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6741em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∘</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">C</span></span></span></span>）：引物与模板链按碱基互补配对结合；</li>\n<li><strong>延伸</strong>（约 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>7</mn><msup><mn>2</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">72^\\circ\\mathrm{C}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">7</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6741em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∘</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">C</span></span></span></span>）：<strong>Taq DNA 聚合酶</strong>从引物的 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>3</mn><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3&#x27;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 端延伸合成新链（原料：4 种游离 dNTP），反复循环。</li>\n</ol>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>A</strong>：双链分开靠高温，<strong>不需要解旋酶</strong> ✓；</li>\n<li><strong>B</strong>：延伸要的是 <strong>DNA 聚合酶</strong>（耐高温的 Taq 酶），不是 RNA 聚合酶 ✗；</li>\n<li><strong>C</strong>：双链模板，需要<strong>两种</strong>引物（上、下链各一条），方向相反 ✗；</li>\n<li><strong>D</strong>：产物是<strong>双链 DNA</strong>（以 DNA 为模板、dNTP 为原料）✗。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>选 <strong>A</strong>。</p>\n","evilHtml":"<p><strong>口诀</strong>：</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>&quot;高温拆、引物接、聚合酶补&quot;</strong>；<strong>&quot;n 轮循环 2ⁿ 倍&quot;</strong>（每轮每个模板翻一倍）。\n<strong>三温度记法</strong>：<strong>&quot;92 拆，55 接，72 补&quot;</strong>——三个温度对应三步（变性/退火/延伸）。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><strong>为什么</strong>：PCR 用的是&quot;温度循环&quot;代替&quot;酶循环&quot;——热解旋的物理手段换掉了解旋酶，所以&quot;不需要解旋酶&quot;必对；聚合酶只补&quot;引物后面的链&quot;，所以引物从单侧无法同时补两条链。</p>\n<p>30 秒出 A。</p>\n","meta":{"status":"draft","keywords":[],"summary":"关于 PCR（聚合酶链式反应）技术，下列叙述正确的是（ ） A. PCR 过程中通过高温使 DNA 双链解旋，不需要解旋酶 B. 延伸阶段需要 RNA 聚合酶 C. PCR 只需要一端的引物即可扩增 D. PCR 的产物是 RNA 单链 扩","source":"自编（经典考法：PCR 为新教材必修/选必高频）","difficulty":"中等","applicability":"选填通用","risk":"PCR 与体内 DNA 复制不同：体外高温变性（92~95°C 使双链解旋）**不需要解旋酶**；需要两种引物（模板链各一条）、4 种 dNTP（原料）、Taq DNA 聚合酶（耐高温）；延伸方向永远是 5'→3'；一轮循环得到 2 倍拷贝，n 轮得到 2ⁿ 倍。","fit":["PCR 三步骤（变性/退火/延伸）与温度","引物与聚合酶","扩增倍数 2ⁿ","选填题"],"updated":"Tue Mar 04 2025 08:00:00 GMT+0800 (中国标准时间)"},"breadcrumbs":[{"slug":"biology","title":"生物"},{"slug":"biotech","title":"生物技术与工程"},{"slug":"bioengineering","title":"生物技术与工程"},{"slug":"pcr-technology","title":"PCR 技术·原理与过程辨析"}],"children":[],"siblings":[{"slug":"biotech","title":"生物技术与工程","type":"knowledge"},{"slug":"fermentation-embryo-problems","title":"发酵工程与胚胎工程选填速练","type":"example"},{"slug":"gene-engineering-problem","title":"基因工程大题·引物设计与答题框架","type":"knowledge"},{"slug":"hybridoma","title":"单克隆抗体制备流程（四步走）","type":"example"},{"slug":"restriction-enzyme","title":"基因工程·限制酶识别与黏性末端","type":"example"}]}